0 \\mathrm{~K}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 活塞缓慢上升了 "},{"type":"math","value":"4 \\mathrm{~cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 正好触碰到报警装置。不考虑水的蒸发, 求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ffbc25635650cbb64a936884ed281e88ebd64542e27f3a6043ccd8f86e457c75.png","width":237,"height":320,"width_mm":27.723,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图\n(1) 气体温度从 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 上升到 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中，气体内能 （填空）（填“增加”、\n“减少”或“不变”），气体（填空）（填“吸收”或“释放”）热量。\n(2) 活塞的质量 m;\n(3) 汽缸内水的体积 V。\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（1）增加 （1分） 吸收 （1分）\n(2) 从温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"到温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"等容变化:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_{0}}{T_{0}} = \\frac{P_{1}}{T_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 活塞恰好离开"},{"type":"math","value":"a, b"},{"type":"text","value":"时:"},{"type":"math","value":"mg + p_{0}S = p_{1}S"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"m = 4\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3) 从温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"到温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"等压变化:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}} = \\frac{V_{1} + S\\Delta h}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"为温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"时气体的体积,"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta h"},{"type":"text","value":"为上升的"},{"type":"math","value":"4\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1} = 1760\\mathrm{cm}^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"水的体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"640\\mathrm{cm}^3"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2412-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2412","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2412-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6974614bda12955fe975665578e7c6d86b08917923123dd2dce1be8955634a18","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）如图所示是某种滑块运动装置，长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" ，以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = 6\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 向左匀速传动，竖直平面内半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆型光滑管道固定在水平地面上，左侧凹槽内有总质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑板，滑板由水平板和四分之一圆弧板两部分构成，水平板上表面平直粗糙，长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1} = 1.5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆弧板表面光滑，半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，距离滑板左端 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2} = 0.25\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处有一锁定装置K，滑板一旦碰到K就被锁定，速度瞬间为0。现有一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块，从传送带的右侧以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 冲上传送带，接着进入圆管完成圆周运动后从E点滑上滑板。已知滑块与传送带之间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块与滑板水平段之间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其它阻力忽略不计，滑块可以视为质点，A、B、C、E在同一水平面，接触面均平滑连接。求：\n（1）要使滑块能滑上滑板，滑块在 B 点的最小速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）若滑块能滑上滑板，求滑块在 E 点的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的函数关系；\n（3）若滑块以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = 4\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 速度滑上滑板，滑块在滑板上运动过程中产生的内能是多少？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6fd5ed9d17f6a7a35368370efe29cb3c67167d61aadd6b4d8444d8cbafde5521.png","width":1151,"height":249,"width_mm":135.257,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2412-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","valu